WEBVTT

01:30.020 --> 01:35.030
Episode 12
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
On the throne—

01:30.440 --> 01:32.440
We know we are not worthy

01:32.440 --> 01:34.030
O great Lord Mitama

01:34.030 --> 01:35.030
On the throne—

01:35.400 --> 01:37.240
What is this?

01:37.530 --> 01:39.570
What do you think you're doing?

01:47.790 --> 01:50.040
Don't you underestimate us 
from the isolation camp!

01:50.040 --> 01:51.210
Here we go!

01:51.210 --> 01:53.670
The "Salvation Through Mitama Song"!

01:56.970 --> 02:00.300
Yeah!

02:01.680 --> 02:02.850
All right!

02:02.850 --> 02:04.060
Alural! Siluril!

02:04.060 --> 02:06.350
Let's turn this up!

02:06.350 --> 02:08.270
Let's go save Mitama-sama!

02:08.270 --> 02:10.400
And Yukito if it's convenient!

02:10.400 --> 02:11.520
Convenient?!

02:11.520 --> 02:12.860
What is that supposed to mean?

02:12.860 --> 02:15.280
Yukito's the one who gave me a place to stay.

02:15.280 --> 02:17.070
S-Sorry about that.

02:20.950 --> 02:22.660
May this reach Yukito!

02:25.580 --> 02:27.750
My powers are getting stronger.

02:27.750 --> 02:28.660
Bertrand!

02:30.330 --> 02:31.380
Take over for me.

02:31.380 --> 02:32.080
What?!

02:32.080 --> 02:33.250
Wait, but...

02:33.250 --> 02:35.340
I can't play!

02:42.510 --> 02:43.800
Wow!

02:43.800 --> 02:46.010
Long live Atar-sama!

02:47.020 --> 02:47.720
All right.

02:47.720 --> 02:48.930
Let's use force.

02:48.930 --> 02:50.940
Please guide me!

02:50.940 --> 02:53.270
Nice one, Atar-tan!

02:53.270 --> 02:54.270
Dakini-sama.

02:54.270 --> 02:54.900
Huh?

02:56.900 --> 02:58.110
Riche-tan!

02:58.110 --> 02:59.570
The pleasure...

03:00.570 --> 03:04.410
Dakini-sama, let's save those 
children Gaia kidnapped.

03:04.910 --> 03:06.700
And in honor of my mother,

03:08.410 --> 03:10.500
get turned on!

03:10.500 --> 03:12.250
Okay.

03:12.250 --> 03:16.710
Let's show them what the 
bond between us is made of!

03:34.860 --> 03:38.730
I knew you could do it 
if you tried, Dakini-sama.

03:38.730 --> 03:39.820
Dakini!

03:39.820 --> 03:41.070
Riche-san!

03:41.070 --> 03:45.200
My body's become unable to resist 
any command from Riche-tan!

03:45.410 --> 03:47.280
When followers get more passionate,

03:47.280 --> 03:49.750
the power of the archons and gods increases!

03:49.750 --> 03:52.410
<i>Isn't that's right, Yukito-san?</i>

03:54.540 --> 03:55.830
Those guys...

03:55.830 --> 03:58.250
They're doing pointless things, yes.

03:58.250 --> 03:59.550
Wow.

03:59.550 --> 04:02.010
It's looks like they're going 
to defeat that strange beast.

04:02.010 --> 04:03.680
No, that's impossible.

04:07.720 --> 04:10.060
Oh, no! Evacuate!

04:20.780 --> 04:22.320
It's not over yet!

04:22.320 --> 04:23.610
Let's keep trying!

04:25.200 --> 04:27.320
Is that... Mitama-chan?

04:28.620 --> 04:30.080
If she's still alive,

04:30.080 --> 04:32.830
her powers must have 
increased just like ours.

04:33.750 --> 04:35.540
But this looks rough.

04:38.500 --> 04:40.380
I stopped that snake.

04:40.380 --> 04:42.260
Did you witness the power of this god?

04:43.300 --> 04:45.050
That's cute.

04:45.050 --> 04:47.550
But I wonder how long you can keep it up?

04:47.550 --> 04:49.220
Hey, Gaia.

04:49.220 --> 04:50.060
What?

04:50.310 --> 04:52.310
I'm busy.

04:52.310 --> 04:55.310
Do you want to get hurt more?

05:02.820 --> 05:04.530
I feel much better.

05:04.530 --> 05:07.160
My head was feeling suspiciously 
foggy all this time.

05:07.530 --> 05:09.120
You fed me something, huh?

05:09.780 --> 05:12.200
I guess you figured it out.

05:12.580 --> 05:14.000
Yukito...

05:14.000 --> 05:16.080
There's one way for us to win...

05:16.080 --> 05:16.830
What?

05:16.830 --> 05:18.830
With my powers right now...

05:18.830 --> 05:21.550
I can just barely stop that snake.

05:22.590 --> 05:26.630
But, Yukito, if you'd become my believer...

05:26.630 --> 05:30.800
I'd get such a super ultra power up 
that I could kill anything in a flash.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.470
All right, Mitama!

05:33.470 --> 05:35.890
This time I'll really become your follower!

05:35.890 --> 05:38.230
But first, you've got to get me out of here.

05:38.230 --> 05:40.900
You should be able to do that even 
with your current power, right?

05:41.610 --> 05:42.610
R-Really?!

05:42.610 --> 05:45.650
If I get you out of those bonds, 
you'll start believing in me?

05:46.030 --> 05:46.530
That's right.

05:47.240 --> 05:48.950
You've got a man's word.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.240
I promise.

05:50.240 --> 05:52.700
So hurry up and get me out of here!

05:54.240 --> 05:56.290
Yes!

05:56.290 --> 06:00.000
Yukito's finally... 
finally going to believe in me!

06:00.000 --> 06:02.170
I'll get you out right now!

06:04.880 --> 06:08.340
All right! Now, become my believer!

06:08.720 --> 06:09.630
Huh?

06:09.630 --> 06:12.300
Did I even say I'd do that?

06:12.300 --> 06:14.060
Whaaat?!

06:14.350 --> 06:17.180
My mind was all fuzzy,

06:17.180 --> 06:18.640
so I can't recall any of that at all.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.850
You fooled me!

06:20.850 --> 06:23.270
I mean, if I had just asked 
you to help me normally,

06:23.270 --> 06:25.570
you would've made excuses 
about not having enough power.

06:25.570 --> 06:28.070
Why did you even put on that 
crap act and pretend to be weak?

06:30.240 --> 06:33.200
Anyway, our friends are 
doing everything they can,

06:33.200 --> 06:35.580
so I can't just stand 
here drooling on myself.

06:36.080 --> 06:38.120
What are you going to do?

06:38.370 --> 06:40.250
I'm going to kill you directly.

06:40.250 --> 06:43.880
Then this monster will stop 
and I can protect my friends.

06:44.420 --> 06:48.630
You try to erase anyone who gets 
in your way without hesitation...

06:48.630 --> 06:52.470
That egotism is why you're utter trash!

06:52.470 --> 06:54.050
Look who's talking!

07:01.770 --> 07:03.520
Sowwie.

07:03.520 --> 07:05.650
Unlike Loki and Dakini,

07:05.650 --> 07:08.110
I can hold my own in close combat.

07:12.450 --> 07:13.870
This looks really bad.

07:15.910 --> 07:17.370
If something ever happens to me,

07:17.370 --> 07:19.370
there's something I need you to do.

07:19.370 --> 07:23.580
I'm sure you'd be better at 
taking charge than anyone else.

07:24.080 --> 07:26.420
I guess that's the only choice.

07:26.420 --> 07:27.090
Huh?

07:27.960 --> 07:29.380
Mission phase two!

07:29.380 --> 07:32.180
Everyone, positions and execution 
are just as we planned!

07:32.760 --> 07:34.180
Are we really going to do it?

07:34.470 --> 07:36.140
If we do it exactly like we practiced,

07:36.140 --> 07:38.010
you can do it to, Atar-sama.

07:38.010 --> 07:40.230
Go get 'em, Atar-tan!

07:40.230 --> 07:43.310
Your reward will be enough ice 
cream to fill an entire room.

07:43.310 --> 07:45.190
Don't you want that?

07:47.020 --> 07:48.070
I have no choice.

07:48.400 --> 07:50.650
It's for protecting the group.

07:50.650 --> 07:51.400
Here.

07:52.150 --> 07:54.070
You got this, Atar!

07:54.320 --> 07:55.070
Okay!

08:03.500 --> 08:05.830
Everyone, please listen.

08:05.830 --> 08:07.000
What happened?

08:07.000 --> 08:08.210
Is Atar-sama...

08:08.210 --> 08:09.380
...crying?

08:09.380 --> 08:13.720
All of you who became my 
believers and supported me,

08:13.720 --> 08:15.640
thank you for everything until now!

08:16.220 --> 08:20.560
The time we spent together shone 
so bright for me, like a dream.

08:22.600 --> 08:26.400
But I'd like to go back 
to being a regular girl!

08:26.400 --> 08:28.940
It's time for me to move on from 
my position as this group's god!

08:28.940 --> 08:30.150
No!

08:30.150 --> 08:31.990
Not Atar-sama of the Three Gods...

08:31.990 --> 08:33.650
Please don't move on!

08:33.950 --> 08:36.070
Such warm words.

08:36.070 --> 08:38.870
My believers really are the best.

08:38.870 --> 08:41.450
But I'd like to reassure you all.

08:41.450 --> 08:43.410
Even if I move on,

08:43.410 --> 08:45.500
this group will still have Mitama.

08:46.040 --> 08:49.710
Mitama-sama can't replace you!

08:49.710 --> 08:51.000
That's right! That's right!

08:51.000 --> 08:52.960
Even if you come to hate me,

08:52.960 --> 08:55.840
I hope that you will never hate Mitama.

08:55.840 --> 08:58.260
I know she'll protect this group,

08:58.260 --> 08:59.850
even if I am no longer here.

09:00.260 --> 09:04.310
So please redirect all the 
devotion you had for me to her!

09:04.310 --> 09:08.400
And what will you do, once 
you have ceased to be a god?

09:08.400 --> 09:11.480
I will explain that.

09:11.480 --> 09:14.570
To be a god means to be 
serviced by believers.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.780
Once she ceases to be a god,

09:16.780 --> 09:19.820
Atar-sama will do the opposite 
and will be servicing believers.

09:19.820 --> 09:21.830
That's what Yukito-san said.

09:21.830 --> 09:23.910
Huh? Wait, I wasn't told about that!

09:23.910 --> 09:26.500
Our Riche-sect will be taking in Atar-sama,

09:26.500 --> 09:28.330
and we promise that she will 
definitely perform her services!

09:28.750 --> 09:29.540
What?

09:29.540 --> 09:32.130
I love bananas.

09:29.540 --> 09:32.130
The Riche-sect that loves 
the banned books...?

09:32.130 --> 09:33.380
Atar-sama, for real?

09:33.840 --> 09:35.840
Let me service you.

09:35.840 --> 09:39.050
But only under the condition 
that Atar-sama's believers

09:39.050 --> 09:41.140
will worship Mitama-sama going forward!

09:41.140 --> 09:42.600
Thanks for everything, Atar-sama!

09:42.600 --> 09:44.640
If it's for Atar-sama, 
we'll support Mitama-sama!

09:44.640 --> 09:46.560
<b>Followers</b>

09:44.640 --> 09:47.600
You don't get to decide for me!

09:46.560 --> 09:48.020
<b>Followers</b>

09:48.020 --> 09:49.100
<b>Followers</b>

09:50.230 --> 09:54.110
<b>Followers</b>

09:50.480 --> 09:52.520
My... number of believers...

09:55.440 --> 09:56.150
That means...

09:57.860 --> 10:00.570
Atar has given up her standing as a god,

10:00.570 --> 10:02.740
and her believers have transferred to you.

10:02.740 --> 10:07.960
Looks like that little girl has finally 
realized her place and became my underling.

10:08.250 --> 10:09.960
She doesn't get it,

10:09.960 --> 10:11.710
but explaining it is a hassle.

10:11.710 --> 10:12.630
All right!

10:12.630 --> 10:14.000
The ultimate! The best! The unlimited!

10:14.000 --> 10:15.460
The countless! Super genius! Invincible!

10:15.460 --> 10:17.300
The one and only god of heaven and earth!

10:17.300 --> 10:20.640
Let me show you Mitama-sama's real power!

10:20.640 --> 10:22.550
Even if you don't believe in me,

10:22.550 --> 10:23.890
I'm still on your side, Yukito.

10:24.470 --> 10:29.560
Because I am your god!

10:53.080 --> 10:55.500
I can't believe you're fighting 
as you're regenerating...

10:55.960 --> 10:58.970
If Mitama's power is keeping me from dying,

10:58.970 --> 11:00.970
I can just ignore the damage!

11:00.970 --> 11:02.510
You bastard!

11:02.510 --> 11:05.470
The crime of damaging 
Yukito's body is severe!

11:05.470 --> 11:06.640
I <i>will</i> kill you!

11:06.640 --> 11:08.770
I'm going to kill you 
and pound you to a pulp!

11:09.770 --> 11:11.190
Even if you don't die,

11:11.190 --> 11:15.730
pain and fear would normally 
make that impossible.

11:16.110 --> 11:17.570
You're so broken.

11:21.990 --> 11:24.570
Good luck, Mitama-chan.

11:24.570 --> 11:25.450
Yukito-san!

11:33.460 --> 11:34.830
Yukito!

11:37.000 --> 11:40.220
Your resistance is futile!

11:40.220 --> 11:42.470
If you're just going to keep regenerating,

11:42.470 --> 11:44.550
I'll keep killing you for infinity,

11:44.550 --> 11:47.220
until the pain breaks your mind!

11:53.000 --> 11:53.710
Huh?

11:54.210 --> 11:56.000
Is this plant...

11:56.500 --> 11:57.920
from Mitama-chan?

11:58.790 --> 12:00.170
It made it in time.

12:02.170 --> 12:03.550
Gotcha!

12:03.880 --> 12:09.510
I kept fighting you to keep your focus on me.

12:09.510 --> 12:11.680
For this one hit!

12:11.680 --> 12:14.770
See? Yukito and I make the perfect team!

12:17.730 --> 12:18.860
It's over.

12:30.740 --> 12:32.120
Yukito!

12:32.330 --> 12:35.330
Yu-ki-to!

12:35.330 --> 12:36.870
Yukito!

12:37.170 --> 12:38.630
I'll fix you right away!

12:40.670 --> 12:41.880
Yukito!

12:47.720 --> 12:48.760
There!

12:51.010 --> 12:52.510
Yukito!

12:56.680 --> 12:59.020
Yukito-san! Thank goodness!

12:59.020 --> 13:00.310
You're alive.

13:00.310 --> 13:01.770
Uh, yeah...

13:03.270 --> 13:06.990
What would I ever do if you died?

13:06.990 --> 13:08.150
R-Right...

13:08.150 --> 13:10.820
Jeez, you're all so over-dramatic.

13:13.120 --> 13:15.200
Looks like I lost.

13:16.500 --> 13:19.960
If you want revenge, 
now's the perfect chance.

13:19.960 --> 13:24.340
I deceived you all and exploited you.

13:24.710 --> 13:26.010
What happened?

13:26.340 --> 13:29.180
Kai? Cyan?

13:40.850 --> 13:42.270
Why are you stopping me?

13:42.980 --> 13:46.150
Please, don't kill her.

13:46.150 --> 13:47.440
Nice, nice!

13:47.440 --> 13:48.570
Kill, kill!

13:48.570 --> 13:51.740
She hurt Yukito, so death is 
the only fitting end for her!

13:51.740 --> 13:52.910
Be quiet.

13:53.580 --> 13:54.910
Let go.

13:55.450 --> 13:56.950
I'm begging you.

13:56.950 --> 13:58.450
Stop, Kai.

14:00.120 --> 14:00.920
Tch.

14:02.130 --> 14:05.590
We'll leave Mom in your hands, then.

14:06.550 --> 14:08.840
End it, Cyan.

14:08.840 --> 14:11.890
I've lived for such an 
unnecessarily long time.

14:13.180 --> 14:18.310
<i>Ah... I... What even was I?</i>

14:18.850 --> 14:21.060
<i>I was used by my family 
ever since I was born.</i>

14:21.640 --> 14:23.860
<i>After I ran away from them,</i>

14:23.860 --> 14:28.110
<i>I was turned into an archon 
and then used as a weapon.</i>

14:28.110 --> 14:31.820
<i>The Empire used me to maintain the nation.</i>

14:32.280 --> 14:35.910
<i>These are the only memories I have.</i>

14:36.450 --> 14:39.910
Mom, why did you try to make a "family"?

14:39.910 --> 14:42.040
I wonder that myself.

14:42.040 --> 14:45.460
Probably because I didn't 
have anything at all.

14:45.460 --> 14:48.130
So maybe I wanted to have "something".

14:48.710 --> 14:54.390
You were not like the perfect 
parents I had in the capital.

14:55.350 --> 15:04.060
But despite having all sorts of 
doubts,	 thoughts, and worries,

15:06.190 --> 15:07.940
you were still our family...

15:09.190 --> 15:10.860
I suppose that's right.

15:10.860 --> 15:14.610
I mean, I don't really know 
what family is, either.

15:15.490 --> 15:16.820
That's fine.

15:17.450 --> 15:20.200
That's just fine!

15:21.580 --> 15:25.330
We just need to find the answer 
to that, piece by piece.

15:25.670 --> 15:27.090
Cyan...

15:27.670 --> 15:31.170
Let's start over and this time,

15:31.170 --> 15:32.760
make a real family.

15:34.130 --> 15:36.470
Let's raise a celebratory glass!

15:36.470 --> 15:39.760
We won!

15:42.270 --> 15:43.640
Hey, hey, hey!

15:43.640 --> 15:45.270
Let's kick this off!

15:45.270 --> 15:48.060
Everyone take off your clothes and have sex!

15:48.650 --> 15:51.730
Ice cream is the most spectacular 
thing in the world.

15:51.730 --> 15:53.400
It is literally sublime.

15:56.780 --> 15:58.570
More than Dakini or Gaia,

15:58.570 --> 16:00.490
it is ice cream that should be worshiped.

16:00.490 --> 16:01.660
Ice cream!

16:01.660 --> 16:03.080
You're so insightful.

16:05.540 --> 16:07.000
Atar-sama.

16:07.000 --> 16:10.500
About that thing... Could you do it here?

16:10.500 --> 16:12.170
What thing?

16:12.170 --> 16:14.470
You know, the servicing!

16:14.470 --> 16:16.010
What are you talking about?

16:16.010 --> 16:19.220
Oh, Riche-chan, so Atar-sama...

16:19.220 --> 16:21.350
Looks like you need treatment.

16:21.350 --> 16:23.520
Huh? Hey, stop!

16:23.520 --> 16:24.230
Help!

16:24.230 --> 16:26.770
Mom, is your wound okay?

16:27.100 --> 16:28.690
It's fine.

16:28.690 --> 16:31.770
But you know, you don't 
have to call me that anymore.

16:33.150 --> 16:34.990
But you're always going to be Mom to me.

16:38.450 --> 16:40.910
Oh, jeez.

16:40.910 --> 16:41.530
Gaia.

16:41.950 --> 16:47.000
We decided to keep you and the children 
who were your believers in our custody.

16:47.000 --> 16:49.830
But to make sure you 
don't do anything stupid,

16:49.830 --> 16:51.590
Kai will be keeping an eye on you.

16:51.920 --> 16:52.800
Hmm.

16:52.800 --> 16:56.050
But I might get him to follow me again.

16:56.050 --> 16:57.300
No.

16:57.300 --> 17:00.470
Kai is going to follow 
my request to the letter.

17:00.890 --> 17:01.850
Right?

17:02.720 --> 17:05.810
That's what you promised, right?

17:06.270 --> 17:07.190
So...

17:07.190 --> 17:08.900
what should I do with you?

17:09.100 --> 17:10.440
Whatever you want.

17:10.440 --> 17:13.190
But I'm letting you know,  
I'm not like Fau or Cain.

17:13.190 --> 17:16.240
I won't be taken in by that Dakini woman.

17:16.240 --> 17:18.910
Nor will I become attached 
to Gaia like Cyan is.

17:19.570 --> 17:21.410
I figured.

17:21.410 --> 17:24.160
You're in love with Cyan, right?

17:24.740 --> 17:25.620
What?

17:25.620 --> 17:27.540
Wh-What the hell are you saying?

17:27.540 --> 17:31.960
Makes sense that neither Dakini 
nor Gaia could win you over.

17:31.960 --> 17:36.090
Because Cyan is the only 
woman for you, right?

17:36.090 --> 17:38.720
Th-That... that's not true!

17:38.720 --> 17:40.970
Dakini's charms didn't work on you,

17:40.970 --> 17:43.300
and you're not devoted to Gaia, either.

17:43.300 --> 17:45.930
But you do listen to Cyan.

17:45.930 --> 17:47.680
It's so obvious.

17:47.680 --> 17:52.060
You probably became Gaia's 
follower for Cyan, right?

17:54.070 --> 17:57.240
So from now on, you keep an eye on Gaia.

17:57.240 --> 17:58.440
For Cyan's sake.

17:58.440 --> 17:58.950
Huh?

17:59.530 --> 18:02.870
She was the only person we couldn't 
extricate from Gaia's grasp.

18:02.870 --> 18:03.990
If we just let them be,

18:03.990 --> 18:05.870
she could be taken advantage of again.

18:05.870 --> 18:08.960
You're the only one who can 
protect Cyan from Gaia.

18:09.460 --> 18:10.330
Right?

18:10.330 --> 18:11.460
Kai-kun?

18:11.460 --> 18:12.790
Right?

18:12.790 --> 18:14.380
Fine!

18:14.380 --> 18:17.050
I'll definitely keep an eye on Gaia!

18:17.590 --> 18:19.010
What's up with you?

18:19.010 --> 18:21.130
Does he have something on you or what?

18:21.130 --> 18:22.430
Shut up!

18:22.430 --> 18:24.430
This is all your fault!

18:24.430 --> 18:25.430
What?

18:27.100 --> 18:29.770
Now you're one of my underlings, too!

18:29.770 --> 18:33.020
My my, being an underling isn't so bad.

18:33.690 --> 18:34.730
Stop it!

18:34.730 --> 18:40.740
You, with just one follower, dare to 
disobey me when I have over 30,000?!

18:40.740 --> 18:43.320
No matter how big the 
difference in followers is,

18:43.320 --> 18:46.450
it doesn't seem to change who's the 
aggressor and who's the victim.

18:46.450 --> 18:47.080
Hm?

18:47.370 --> 18:49.790
30,000 followers?

18:49.790 --> 18:52.330
Even if she absorbed all of Atar's followers,

18:52.580 --> 18:54.670
she shouldn't have reached 30,000...

18:54.670 --> 18:55.500
Could it be?!

18:55.960 --> 18:57.300
Congratulations.

18:57.590 --> 18:59.510
Looks like you bested Gaia.

18:59.760 --> 19:00.840
Loki...

19:00.840 --> 19:03.380
Are you responsible for 
Mitama's follower count?

19:03.380 --> 19:04.050
Yep.

19:04.340 --> 19:08.390
Having Typhon attack the capital 
right now would have been annoying,

19:08.390 --> 19:09.930
so I lent you some power.

19:09.930 --> 19:15.230
I used my own power to transfer a 
part of my followers to Mitama-chan.

19:15.230 --> 19:18.400
You're moving pieces on the 
chessboard as you please, eh?

19:18.400 --> 19:19.820
Feeling quite godly, huh?

19:20.820 --> 19:21.990
Don't underestimate us.

19:21.990 --> 19:24.530
Keep looking down at us and laughing.

19:24.530 --> 19:26.870
The preparations to crush you continue.

19:27.410 --> 19:29.240
I don't underestimate you at all.

19:29.240 --> 19:32.080
I'm the one who admires your 
abilities more than anyone else.

19:32.870 --> 19:35.670
Nobody understands you like I do.

19:36.170 --> 19:39.300
Looking forward to seeing 
you again in the capital.

19:40.670 --> 19:44.800
Help me, Yukito!

19:52.980 --> 19:54.350
Yukito-san!

19:55.020 --> 19:56.900
There you are!

19:56.900 --> 19:58.060
We've been looking for you.

19:58.060 --> 19:59.690
You just disappeared.

19:59.690 --> 20:02.610
What's with the serious face?

20:03.950 --> 20:06.700
I was just remembering all the things that 
happened since I came to this village.

20:06.700 --> 20:08.990
Al found me here.

20:08.990 --> 20:12.080
Oh, you mean that time!

20:12.080 --> 20:13.620
How embarrassing!

20:13.620 --> 20:15.000
Did you do something?

20:15.000 --> 20:16.250
N-Nothing!

20:16.250 --> 20:18.290
So many things have happened 
since I came to this village.

20:18.290 --> 20:21.050
Things you can laugh about, 
things you can't laugh about.

20:21.340 --> 20:24.130
You know, I never had 
any friends in the past.

20:24.510 --> 20:26.050
Some terrible things have happened,

20:26.340 --> 20:30.430
but just the fact that I got to 
meet you makes me glad I came here.

20:31.060 --> 20:31.810
Come on.

20:31.810 --> 20:33.430
You're making me blush.

20:33.430 --> 20:34.810
Yukito-san.

20:34.810 --> 20:39.730
To me, my friends in this village are 
more important than anything else.

20:39.730 --> 20:44.570
Which is why I will do anything 
to protect this village.

20:50.700 --> 20:53.040
You can't just sneak out like that!

20:53.040 --> 20:54.750
That's right!

20:54.750 --> 20:57.620
You're completely shitfaced...

20:57.620 --> 20:59.420
Sorry about that Yukito.

20:59.420 --> 21:01.040
You idiots,

21:01.040 --> 21:03.090
don't come crying to me if you get sick.

21:03.630 --> 21:04.460
What did I just say?

21:04.460 --> 21:07.260
Yuki-tan, listen!

21:07.260 --> 21:10.010
I was thinking of forming a 
team for making banned books!

21:10.300 --> 21:13.430
Wouldn't thin books with 
pictures be super rad?!

21:13.430 --> 21:15.220
Atar-tan would be the main character!

21:15.220 --> 21:17.850
No clue what you mean, but definitely no!

21:17.850 --> 21:19.440
That's a wonderful idea!

21:19.440 --> 21:22.190
If my mother were alive, she'd be so happy!

21:19.440 --> 21:22.190
Let go, my ice cream is melting.

21:22.480 --> 21:24.110
Do whatever.

21:24.110 --> 21:28.400
Either way, everything will be 
settled if you become my follower.

21:28.400 --> 21:29.610
Right, Yukito?

21:29.610 --> 21:30.780
Yeah, nope.

21:30.780 --> 21:33.030
Damn it!

21:31.490 --> 21:33.370
M-Mitama-sama.

21:33.370 --> 21:36.750
After all, you're the only one for m—

21:36.750 --> 21:39.960
You're so terrible you're 
even a disgrace to perverts.

21:39.960 --> 21:43.090
We're going to party until morning!

21:43.090 --> 21:44.630
Yeah!

21:44.630 --> 21:47.410
But you have to be right in the middle of it.

21:47.760 --> 21:49.050
She's right.

21:49.050 --> 21:51.190
You can't just leave like that.

21:51.600 --> 21:52.910
You're right.

21:53.670 --> 21:54.660
Yukito-san.

21:53.670 --> 21:54.660
Yukito.

21:56.060 --> 21:57.430
Yukito!

21:57.430 --> 22:00.020
Become my follower!

22:00.020 --> 22:02.540
Shut up, get off me!

22:07.970 --> 22:09.690
Let's go, Yukito-san!

22:09.690 --> 22:11.050
Come on, Yukito!

22:15.080 --> 22:17.220
<i>This world is the worst,</i>

22:17.220 --> 22:18.520
<i>but it's also the best.</i>

22:19.080 --> 22:22.660
<i>These people don't need any god.</i>
